                <pb facs="0955" n="945" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg945"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.3396/2–347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-02-05T15:00:00-05:00">February 5, 1947—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>141. I fully concur in views expressed your 193 Feb 3, 7 p.m. and am taking up
                    matter with Secretary Forrestal.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
